  "details": "Since the calibration method has been slightly changed and you may not have access to a mirror that displays your tracking balls at each time that you need to calibrate, have a mirror appear locally to the calibrating player until they snap into tracking. Since you can't really look down anymore during calibration because the model is anchored to your head, this would help people who like the reassurance of calibrating correctly and accurately and help them not rely on an old launch option to snap into their avatars in a way they're used to.",
